B.Rc=new A.bx("bld_bridge",B.as,"Ah\u015fap Su K\xf6pr\xfcs\xfc (Ge\xe7it)","Timber Bridge (Waterway Crossing)","Deniz ve g\xf6l karolar\u0131 \xfczerine kurularak su \xfcst\xfcnden kara yolu ve lojistik ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 sa\u011flar.","Constructed over water tiles to link islands and enable overland logistics.","Su K\xf6pr\xfcs\xfc, g\xf6l veya deniz karolar\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerine in\u015fa edilir. Su engelini a\u015farak i\u015f\xe7ilerin ve kervanlar\u0131n su \xfcst\xfcnden do\u011frudan kar\u015f\u0131 k\u0131y\u0131ya ge\xe7ebilmesini sa\u011flar; harita kopukluklar\u0131n\u0131 birle\u015ftirir.","Built over Sea hexes, connecting disconnected landmasses for uninterrupted logistics.",B.vA,B.dL,"SV.20 | DEN\u0130Z",B.a2R,B.I,B.I,B.V7,B.YA,B.WG)
