B.Ri=new A.bx("buildings_chains_overview",B.as,"\xdcretim Zincirleri & 3-Tier Mimari","Production Chains & 3-Tier Architecture","Hammaddeden i\u015flenmi\u015f mamullere ve efsanevi silahlara uzanan derin \xfcretim piramidi.","Deep production pipeline from raw resources to refined goods and mythical arms.","HexRush ekonomisi 3 katmanl\u0131 girdi-\xe7\u0131kt\u0131 mant\u0131\u011f\u0131yla i\u015fler:\n\n\u2022 Tier 1 (Hammadde): Bu\u011fday, Arpa, Odun, Ta\u015f, Demir filizi, Bal\u0131k.\n\u2022 Tier 2 (\u0130\u015flenmi\u015f Mamul): Yel De\u011firmeni bu\u011fday\u0131 Un yapar, H\u0131zar Ota\u011f\u0131 odunu Kalas/Kereste yapar, F\u0131r\u0131n ekmek pi\u015firir, Marangoz mobilya \xfcretir.\n\u2022 Tier 3 (Bozk\u0131r Zanaat): K\u0131m\u0131z Ota\u011f\u0131 (K\u0131m\u0131z \u015fifas\u0131), Ke\xe7e At\xf6lyesi (Z\u0131rh ke\xe7esi), \u015eam Oca\u011f\u0131 (Demir+Obsidyen = \u015eam \xc7eli\u011fi), Tah\u0131l Mahzeni (Kapasite deposu).","Tier 1 gathers raw crops, timber, stone, and ores. Tier 2 refines them into Flour, Planks, Bread, and Furniture. Tier 3 crafts Kumis, Felt armor, Damascus Steel, and Granary storage.",B.SL,B.T,"3 T\u0130ER Z\u0130NC\u0130R",B.a29,B.I,B.I,B.Y7,B.Wn,B.W3)
