B.Rp=new A.bx("bld_worker",B.as,"\u0130\u015f\xe7i Kul\xfcbesi & Lojistik A\u011f\u0131","Worker Hut & Logistics Hub","4 Hex yar\u0131\xe7ap\u0131ndaki tarlalar\u0131 ve madenleri otomatik toplay\u0131p merkeze ta\u015f\u0131yan i\u015f\xe7iler \xe7\u0131kar\u0131r. (G\u0131da depolayamaz)","Spawns logistical workers that patrol a 4-hex radius, collecting yields automatically. (Cannot store food)","\u0130\u015f\xe7i Kul\xfcbesi, hammadde, ah\u015fap, ta\u015f ve maden lojisti\u011fini otomatikle\u015ftirir. \xc7evresindeki \xfcretim binalar\u0131ndan sanayi malzemelerini toplar. \xd6NEML\u0130: \u0130\u015f\xe7i kul\xfcbeleri g\u0131da depolayamaz; g\u0131da \xfcr\xfcnleri tarlalardan ve f\u0131r\u0131nlardan sadece G\u0131da Ambar\u0131 veya Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan depolan\u0131p ta\u015f\u0131n\u0131r.","Automates raw material, timber, stone, and ore gathering in a 4-hex radius. IMPORTANT: Worker Huts cannot store food; food products are stored and hauled exclusively via Food Storehouses or the Khan's Yurt.",B.Sh,B.Q,"SV.1 | \xc7AYIR",B.a2l,B.I,B.I,B.Wc,B.a_R,B.Vf)
